{"id":"5f8f393a8c1e0e49","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset.md","title":"ZFC Rel Dense Subset Poset","display":"df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset — ZFC Rel Dense Subset Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset — ZFC Rel Dense Subset Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset — ZFC Rel Dense Subset Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> (partially ordered carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq P\">\\(D\\subseteq P\\)</span> (subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\">\\(\\leq_P\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDenseSubsetPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelDenseSubsetPoset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRelDenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRelDenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Density is a notion for arbitrary partial orders and does not require a distinguished top condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P$ (partially ordered carrier, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-order","status":"resolved","id":"2aa29158e60b337f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Order}_S$ (partial-order predicate, see [[58-df-order]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"D\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Order}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelDenseSubsetPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}dense\\text{-}subset\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRelDenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Order}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)","display":true}],"bytes":972,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3305","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset.md|58-df-zfc-rel-dense-subset-poset]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2aa29158e60b337f"]}